  "text": "proprium.feria-v-in-cena-domini-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Holy Thursday — Mass of the Lord's Supper” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O God, from Whom Judas received the punishment of his guilt and the thief the reward of his confession, grant unto us the fruit of Thy propitiation; that as Jesus Christ our Lord in His Passion rendered unto each a different recompense according to his deserts, so, taking away the error of our former life, He may bestow upon us the grace of His resurrection. He liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
